+    <Entry Name="HintLookAround">Turn your head to look around, and use the right stick to turn.[br]Hold Y on the left controller (B on Valve Index) to re-center your view.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintMoveAround">Use the left stick to move. Click it while moving to run.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintDoors">To open doors and containers, grab the handle with the trigger or grip, then push or pull.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintGrabRotate">Turn your wrist to rotate the object you are holding.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintGrabMove">Move your hand to bring the object you are holding closer or further away.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintGrabThrow">Swing your arm and let go to throw the object you are holding.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintGrabHowTo">Reach out and squeeze the trigger or grip to grab an object.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintGrabHowTo_Toggle">Reach out and squeeze the trigger or grip to grab an object. Let go to drop it.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintWheel">Grab the wheel and turn it with your hand.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintSlider">Grab it, then push or pull with your hand.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintInteract">Reach out and squeeze the trigger or grip to interact with objects.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintPickUpItem">Reach out and squeeze the trigger or grip to pick up items.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintRun">Click the left stick while moving to run.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintRunAlt">Click the left stick while moving to run.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintRunAlt_Toggle">Click the left stick while moving to run. Click it again, or stop moving, to walk.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintJump">Push the right stick up to jump.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintInventory">Press B to open your inventory.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintCrouch">Pull the right stick down, or duck, to crouch.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintSneak">Moving while crouched makes less noise and reduces the chance of being noticed.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintFlashlight">Reach to the left side of your chest with your left hand and squeeze to take out or put away the flashlight. Clicking the right stick also works.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintLean">Lean your body to peek around corners.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintLean_Toggle">Lean your body to peek around corners.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="InteractiveAnimation">Push the left stick forward to continue.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintNotes">Notes you pick up are kept in the Notes tab of your inventory.[br]Press B while the icon is flashing to go straight to the new note.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintCloseSketchbook">Press B or the menu button to close the inventory.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintDynamoLantern">Pull the flashlight's cord with your right hand to charge it, but be careful not to make too much noise!</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintDynamoLantern_Toggle">Pull the flashlight's cord with your right hand to charge it, but be careful not to make too much noise!</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintPocketWatch">Raise the pocket watch to read it. When it stops, pinch its crown with your left hand and twist to wind it, then press the crown to start it.</Entry>
+    <Entry Name="HintPocketWatch_Toggle">Raise the pocket watch to read it. When it stops, pinch its crown with your left hand and twist to wind it, then press the crown to start it.</Entry>
